WEBVTT

1
00:00:38,541 --> 00:00:40,666
<i>Aku penggemar Spurs. Dia…</i>

2
00:00:43,416 --> 00:00:45,875
<i>Aku punya teman kencan baru pekan depan…</i>

3
00:00:47,958 --> 00:00:51,457
<i>- Kita perlu kepemimpinan yang tepat.
- Terserah kau apakan tempat itu.</i>

4
00:00:51,458 --> 00:00:52,416
<i>…untuk lisensi…</i>

5
00:00:52,875 --> 00:00:54,416
Aku tak bisa datang hari Jumat.

6
00:00:56,416 --> 00:00:58,874
Aku tak punya uang.

7
00:00:58,875 --> 00:01:00,832
<i>- Ponselku baru.
- Kurasa sudah beres.</i>

8
00:01:00,833 --> 00:01:02,540
<i>Mobil hatchback hitam.</i>

9
00:01:02,541 --> 00:01:03,916
Aku menelepon dia tiga kali.

10
00:01:04,875 --> 00:01:07,915
<i>- Aku butuh uang untuk cicilan, tagihan.
- Kalau mau…</i>

11
00:01:07,916 --> 00:01:09,582
<i>Dengan latihan beberapa hari,</i>

12
00:01:09,583 --> 00:01:11,832
<i>bisa belajar berputar
seperti balerina prima.</i>

13
00:01:11,833 --> 00:01:14,832
<i>Aku akan marah jika harus
memberi tahu letak pencetak lagi.</i>

14
00:01:14,833 --> 00:01:16,000
<i>Tempatnya masih sama.</i>

15
00:01:17,041 --> 00:01:19,040
<i>Kita tak perlu bertengkar lagi</i>

16
00:01:19,041 --> 00:01:21,375
<i>jika kau mendengarkan aku sejak awal.</i>

17
00:01:21,958 --> 00:01:25,207
<i>Suplemen ini membuatku
merasa lebih jantan.</i>

18
00:01:25,208 --> 00:01:28,041
<i>Manajer mengawasi kita
di kamera dari kantornya.</i>

19
00:01:28,750 --> 00:01:30,957
<i>Memangnya bohong tak berbahaya?</i>

20
00:01:30,958 --> 00:01:33,333
Emma pergi nanti malam…
pakai celana

21
00:01:35,333 --> 00:01:38,375
<i>Dengar, ini kesempatan
sekali seumur hidup.</i>

22
00:01:39,333 --> 00:01:40,874
<i>Baiklah…</i>

23
00:01:40,875 --> 00:01:44,291
<i>Jika ada yang tahu soal ini,
matilah kalian. Titik.</i>

24
00:01:44,833 --> 00:01:48,000
Gram kokaina? - Buang alat di mana?
Jam berapa Seamus datang?

25
00:01:49,083 --> 00:01:51,250
<i>- Saat Raja Kejayaan datang…
- Kau masalahku!</i>

26
00:02:03,416 --> 00:02:05,166
Kau makin jago.

27
00:02:06,625 --> 00:02:10,374
Ada sidang penting di pengadilan nanti.
Ibu agak gugup.

28
00:02:10,375 --> 00:02:12,958
Aku harus bertanding futbol.
Aku benci itu.

29
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:20,749
Ayo, bersiaplah.

30
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:23,250
- Aku siap sejak tadi.
- Ya?

31
00:02:25,125 --> 00:02:26,875
Sudah ganti kapsul insulinmu?

32
00:02:27,583 --> 00:02:29,500
- Ya.
- Berapa hasilnya?

33
00:02:31,166 --> 00:02:32,082
NOAH
DATA TERBARU

34
00:02:32,083 --> 00:02:33,625
Sembilan puluh enam. Aman.

35
00:03:01,583 --> 00:03:04,791
Satu, dua, dan…

36
00:03:06,208 --> 00:03:07,041
tiga.

37
00:03:10,291 --> 00:03:11,166
Ayo berangkat.

38
00:03:15,875 --> 00:03:19,332
Kami buat penggalangan dana
untuk lempar spons ke Tn. Pearson.

39
00:03:19,333 --> 00:03:20,333
- Benarkah?
- Ya.

40
00:03:27,083 --> 00:03:28,125
Sampai nanti!

41
00:03:29,708 --> 00:03:32,375
Mau coba berangkat sendiri hari ini?

42
00:03:34,125 --> 00:03:35,375
Ayo. Coba saja.

43
00:03:38,208 --> 00:03:40,458
Namun, aku suka saat Ibu mengantarku.

44
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:43,666
Ibu tahu, tetapi mencoba
hal baru itu bagus.

45
00:03:44,791 --> 00:03:47,166
Ingat saat kau takut berseluncur es?

46
00:03:49,791 --> 00:03:51,625
Ibu yang akan merindukannya.

47
00:03:55,375 --> 00:03:56,416
Ibu menyayangimu.

48
00:03:59,625 --> 00:04:01,165
Ibu bangga kepadamu.

49
00:04:01,166 --> 00:04:03,500
Jangan lupa memeriksa kadar glukosamu.

50
00:04:04,916 --> 00:04:06,166
Ibu menyayangimu, Sayang.

51
00:04:06,750 --> 00:04:07,791
Aku sayang Ibu.

52
00:04:15,583 --> 00:04:16,957
<i>Ted McBain menelepon.</i>

53
00:04:16,958 --> 00:04:18,416
TELEPON MASUK
TED MCBAIN

54
00:04:20,708 --> 00:04:22,333
- Hai, Ted.
<i>- Selamat pagi.</i>

55
00:04:23,250 --> 00:04:26,708
<i>Waktu penjemputan saksi
diubah menjadi pukul 10.15.</i>

56
00:04:27,333 --> 00:04:28,291
Baiklah.

57
00:04:29,250 --> 00:04:31,457
<i>Kau punya cukup waktu untuk berlari?</i>

58
00:04:31,458 --> 00:04:32,375
Ya, tak masalah.

59
00:04:35,333 --> 00:04:36,791
<i>Bisa mengobrol soal semalam?</i>

60
00:04:37,625 --> 00:04:39,915
<i>Kukira kau senang, lalu…</i>

61
00:04:39,916 --> 00:04:41,999
Kau sudah katakan kemauanmu.

62
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:44,250
Kau tak mau punya anak. Aku punya Noah.

63
00:04:44,750 --> 00:04:45,625
Itu masalahnya.

64
00:04:47,291 --> 00:04:50,832
<i>- Aku perlu memikirkan…</i>
- Aku paham posisimu.

65
00:04:50,833 --> 00:04:52,707
Sungguh, jika aku tak punya Noah

66
00:04:52,708 --> 00:04:55,582
aku ragu mau terlibat
dengan orang yang punya anak.

67
00:04:55,583 --> 00:04:58,082
- Tak apa.
<i>- Kau coba mendebatnya,</i>

68
00:04:58,083 --> 00:05:00,458
<i>- tapi bukan itu maksudku.</i>
- Ted, aku harus lari.

69
00:05:01,083 --> 00:05:02,458
Sampai jumpa di kantor.

70
00:05:03,208 --> 00:05:04,041
<i>Maia…</i>

71
00:05:10,041 --> 00:05:12,000
BERLARI KE KANTOR
HEART OF GLASS - BLONDIE

72
00:05:41,583 --> 00:05:43,374
TELEPON MASUK
FLORA GIBSON

73
00:05:43,375 --> 00:05:45,375
<i>Flora Gibson menelepon.</i>

74
00:05:46,833 --> 00:05:48,457
- Maia Marten.
<i>- Polisi ke sini.</i>

75
00:05:48,458 --> 00:05:50,665
<i>Katamu, perangkatku tak akan disita.</i>

76
00:05:50,666 --> 00:05:53,375
<i>- Aku tak tahu harus apa!</i>
- Flora, stop. Tenang.

77
00:05:55,041 --> 00:05:55,875
Bagus.

78
00:05:56,625 --> 00:05:58,583
Jangan bicara dengan polisi tanpa aku.

79
00:05:59,166 --> 00:06:00,000
Paham?

80
00:06:00,583 --> 00:06:01,915
<i>Baiklah.</i>

81
00:06:01,916 --> 00:06:04,082
Suamimu hanya ingin menakutimu.

82
00:06:04,083 --> 00:06:07,083
<i>Aku yang berkata jujur, Maia.
Dia penjahatnya.</i>

83
00:06:08,125 --> 00:06:09,290
Dengarkan aku.

84
00:06:09,291 --> 00:06:13,250
Sembilan puluh sembilan persen
cerita pembelaan diri itu benar.

85
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,375
Mengendalikan narasi.

86
00:06:16,041 --> 00:06:17,500
<i>Apa satu persen sisanya?</i>

87
00:06:19,416 --> 00:06:20,375
Tidak bersalah.

88
00:06:22,375 --> 00:06:24,541
Flora, aku harus berlari.

89
00:07:06,791 --> 00:07:08,707
TELEPON MASUK
NOAH

90
00:07:08,708 --> 00:07:09,625
<i>Noah menelepon.</i>

91
00:07:13,083 --> 00:07:15,165
Apa yang terlupa sekarang?

92
00:07:15,166 --> 00:07:17,040
<i>Aku tak lupa apa pun, Maia.</i>

93
00:07:17,041 --> 00:07:18,583
<i>Ingatanku sempurna.</i>

94
00:07:20,791 --> 00:07:23,000
Siapa ini?
Kenapa kau pakai ponsel putraku?

95
00:07:25,375 --> 00:07:26,625
<i>Karena putramu bersamaku.</i>

96
00:07:27,291 --> 00:07:28,125
Apa?

97
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:29,915
<i>Di taman.</i>

98
00:07:29,916 --> 00:07:31,541
<i>Di Kuil Venus.</i>

99
00:07:34,916 --> 00:07:35,875
Siapa ini?

100
00:07:36,500 --> 00:07:38,375
<i>Anggap aku sebagai kekuatan perubahan.</i>

101
00:07:39,208 --> 00:07:40,541
<i>Kau terjebak rutinitas.</i>

102
00:07:41,125 --> 00:07:44,791
<i>Kau pesan ramen ayam yang sama
tiap pekan selama lima tahun ini.</i>

103
00:07:46,458 --> 00:07:47,625
Alan, itukah kau?

104
00:07:48,583 --> 00:07:51,208
<i>Mendengarkanmu, mencari penjelasan.</i>

105
00:07:51,875 --> 00:07:54,750
Tidak, pasti membawa ponsel putraku
dan sedang iseng.

106
00:07:55,583 --> 00:07:57,541
<i>Lalu kenapa kau berjalan menuju kuil?</i>

107
00:08:04,375 --> 00:08:07,249
<i>Jika kau tak percaya,
Noah bisa katakan sendiri.</i>

108
00:08:07,250 --> 00:08:08,582
<i>Noah, sapa ibumu.</i>

109
00:08:08,583 --> 00:08:10,707
<i>Bu, dia belikan es krim keping cokelat.</i>

110
00:08:10,708 --> 00:08:12,249
<i>- Aku suka.</i>
- Noah, kau di mana?

111
00:08:12,250 --> 00:08:13,415
<i>Di kuil.</i>

112
00:08:13,416 --> 00:08:16,457
<i>- Ibu di sini?</i>
- Tetap di sana. Jangan ke mana-mana.

113
00:08:16,458 --> 00:08:17,499
<i>Aku harus pergi.</i>

114
00:08:17,500 --> 00:08:20,500
<i>- Teman Ibu bilang kita bertemu nanti.</i>
- Menjauhlah dari…

115
00:08:48,875 --> 00:08:50,958
Astaga. Kenapa dia melakukan itu?

116
00:09:11,625 --> 00:09:13,207
Hei! Menjauh darinya!

117
00:09:13,208 --> 00:09:14,582
- Apa maumu?
- Maaf.

118
00:09:14,583 --> 00:09:16,500
Tak apa-apa, Sayang.

119
00:09:18,125 --> 00:09:20,666
IKUTIANAKKU - SAAT INI
NOAH

120
00:09:30,333 --> 00:09:32,708
- Di sana kau rupanya.
- Maaf terlambat.

121
00:09:33,708 --> 00:09:34,708
Tak apa.

122
00:09:36,083 --> 00:09:36,916
Noah!

123
00:09:39,541 --> 00:09:40,375
Noah!

124
00:09:41,583 --> 00:09:42,583
Noah!

125
00:09:56,333 --> 00:09:57,333
Noah!

126
00:10:00,875 --> 00:10:02,582
TELEPON MASUK
PENELEPON TAK DIKENAL

127
00:10:02,583 --> 00:10:03,665
Di mana kau?

128
00:10:03,666 --> 00:10:07,250
<i>Ny. Marten, Anda menang 100.000 paun…</i>

129
00:10:08,666 --> 00:10:10,332
PENELEPON TAK DIKENAL

130
00:10:10,333 --> 00:10:11,208
Kau di sini?

131
00:10:12,708 --> 00:10:13,541
Halo?

132
00:10:14,166 --> 00:10:15,333
<i>Halo.</i>

133
00:10:17,125 --> 00:10:20,375
Dengarkan aku.
Berhenti main-main. Kau di mana?

134
00:10:20,833 --> 00:10:22,790
<i>Maia, tenanglah.</i>

135
00:10:22,791 --> 00:10:26,499
Jika kau menyentuhnya,
aku bersumpah akan membunuhmu.

136
00:10:26,500 --> 00:10:28,915
<i>Jika kita mau lanjut, kau harus tenang.</i>

137
00:10:28,916 --> 00:10:31,083
Beraninya kau menyuruhku tenang?

138
00:10:35,666 --> 00:10:38,790
Apa kau terdakwa dalam salah satu kasusku?
Jika ya…

139
00:10:38,791 --> 00:10:40,415
<i>Kau punya pikiran logis,</i>

140
00:10:40,416 --> 00:10:43,250
<i>tetapi kadang, logika tak cukup.</i>

141
00:10:52,958 --> 00:10:54,291
<i>Jangan lapor polisi.</i>

142
00:10:55,416 --> 00:10:57,041
<i>Itu katamu kepada Flora, 'kan?</i>

143
00:11:03,416 --> 00:11:06,833
<i>Ini permainan yang sederhana,
seperti Ular Tangga.</i>

144
00:11:07,833 --> 00:11:10,583
<i>Jika kau ikuti aturanku, Noah selamat.</i>

145
00:11:11,166 --> 00:11:13,708
<i>Jika tak patuh, dia mati.</i>

146
00:11:17,458 --> 00:11:20,666
<i>Aturan nomor satu,
kau hanya bicara denganku.</i>

147
00:11:21,500 --> 00:11:26,000
<i>Melalui telepon, di jalan,
tak ada orang lain. Paham?</i>

148
00:11:27,333 --> 00:11:28,332
<i>Paham?</i>

149
00:11:28,333 --> 00:11:30,332
Ya, aku paham.

150
00:11:30,333 --> 00:11:34,249
<i>Aturan kedua, turuti setiap perintahku.</i>

151
00:11:34,250 --> 00:11:35,666
<i>Jangan membuatku bosan.</i>

152
00:11:47,125 --> 00:11:48,707
<i>Kau masih di taman?</i>

153
00:11:48,708 --> 00:11:49,665
Tidak.

154
00:11:49,666 --> 00:11:52,041
<i>Kami hampir tiba di rumah. Ya, 'kan, Noah?</i>

155
00:11:53,833 --> 00:11:55,583
Jadi, mari kita mulai.

156
00:11:56,125 --> 00:11:58,041
<i>- Tahu kolam renang pria?</i>
- Ya.

157
00:11:58,958 --> 00:12:00,125
<i>Larilah ke sana.</i>

158
00:12:15,791 --> 00:12:18,000
<i>Kini, lihat ke tempat sampah merah.</i>

159
00:12:36,958 --> 00:12:37,791
<i>Kau menemukannya?</i>

160
00:12:40,208 --> 00:12:41,500
<i>Ada paket di dalamnya.</i>

161
00:13:08,791 --> 00:13:12,249
<i>Saksi utamamu, Tn. Radian Tafa</i>

162
00:13:12,250 --> 00:13:14,916
<i>sedang dilindungi secara ketat
di Hotel Excelsus.</i>

163
00:13:15,875 --> 00:13:17,874
<i>Ini hari persidangannya.</i>

164
00:13:17,875 --> 00:13:21,624
<i>Pukul 10.15, dia akan dibawa ke Old Bailey</i>

165
00:13:21,625 --> 00:13:23,875
<i>untuk bersaksi melawan atasanku.</i>

166
00:13:24,583 --> 00:13:28,583
<i>Namun, itu tak akan terjadi
karena kau akan membunuhnya dahulu.</i>

167
00:13:32,458 --> 00:13:33,416
Kau terlambat.

168
00:13:34,875 --> 00:13:37,208
Dia dipindahkan semalam.
Dia tak ada di sana.

169
00:13:37,875 --> 00:13:41,832
<i>Aku telah mendengar banyak hal hebat
tentang Maia Marten</i>

170
00:13:41,833 --> 00:13:45,166
<i>dan kemampuan
memutarbalikkan fakta di ruang sidang,</i>

171
00:13:46,250 --> 00:13:49,541
<i>tetapi kau malah
mengatakan kebohongan kecil.</i>

172
00:13:50,875 --> 00:13:54,790
<i>Aku tahu kau satu dari enam orang
yang bisa bertemu Tafa hari ini</i>

173
00:13:54,791 --> 00:13:56,500
<i>karena kau menulisnya di surel.</i>

174
00:14:00,666 --> 00:14:03,332
Jika kau anak buah Boyd,
aku bisa memberimu kekebalan.

175
00:14:03,333 --> 00:14:05,875
- Kau bisa bersaksi. Kita perbaiki semua.
<i>- Maia.</i>

176
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:09,749
<i>Aku ini pekerja lepas. Seorang spesialis.</i>

177
00:14:09,750 --> 00:14:12,040
Berapa pun dia membayarmu, kugandakan.

178
00:14:12,041 --> 00:14:14,249
<i>Aku tahu saldo bankmu. Kau tak mampu.</i>

179
00:14:14,250 --> 00:14:16,290
Aku bisa cari uangnya. Percayalah.

180
00:14:16,291 --> 00:14:18,290
<i>Jangan membuatku bosan.</i>

181
00:14:18,291 --> 00:14:19,540
Kenapa harus aku?

182
00:14:19,541 --> 00:14:21,250
<i>Kau tahu alasannya, Maia.</i>

183
00:14:25,875 --> 00:14:27,457
Aku tak bisa membunuh.

184
00:14:27,458 --> 00:14:28,999
<i>Kurasa kau bisa.</i>

185
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:33,166
<i>- Kau ingin Noah hidup, bukan?</i>
- Jangan libatkan Noah. Kumohon!

186
00:14:44,875 --> 00:14:47,915
NOMOR TAK DIKENAL
KAU MEMBUATKU BOSAN. MINTA MAAF.

187
00:14:47,916 --> 00:14:50,750
PASANG PENYUARA TELINGAMU LAGI.

188
00:15:02,875 --> 00:15:04,291
Maaf aku membuatmu bosan.

189
00:15:06,416 --> 00:15:07,666
Akan kulakukan apa pun.

190
00:15:08,958 --> 00:15:10,915
<i>- Terima kasih, Bu.</i>
- Noah?

191
00:15:10,916 --> 00:15:12,290
<i>Aku suka teman Ibu.</i>

192
00:15:12,291 --> 00:15:14,582
<i>- Bisakah dia jadi ayahku?</i>
- Apa?

193
00:15:14,583 --> 00:15:16,832
<i>Bisakah dia jadi ayahku?</i>

194
00:15:16,833 --> 00:15:18,374
<i>- Bisa jadi ayahku?</i>
- Halo?

195
00:15:18,375 --> 00:15:19,291
Kau baik-baik saja?

196
00:15:23,291 --> 00:15:24,750
<i>AI memang menakjubkan, bukan?</i>

197
00:15:25,291 --> 00:15:28,500
<i>Tak seharusnya AI dilepas
kepada masyarakat umum.</i>

198
00:15:29,625 --> 00:15:31,500
<i>Periksalah kadar glukosanya.</i>

199
00:15:35,458 --> 00:15:37,374
DATA TERAKHIR - 32 MG/DL
HIPOGLIKEMIA

200
00:15:37,375 --> 00:15:39,083
<i>Tiga puluh dua cukup rendah, bukan?</i>

201
00:15:40,958 --> 00:15:43,000
Kau meretas dispenser insulinnya?

202
00:15:43,625 --> 00:15:47,375
<i>Kuberi dosis tambahan,
kini dia sedang koma hipoglikemia.</i>

203
00:16:02,250 --> 00:16:03,958
<i>Satu dosis lagi akan mematikan.</i>

204
00:16:04,916 --> 00:16:06,333
<i>Namun, infusnya lambat.</i>

205
00:16:07,625 --> 00:16:08,708
<i>Dia akan hidup</i>

206
00:16:09,416 --> 00:16:10,583
<i>selama satu jam.</i>

207
00:16:13,291 --> 00:16:17,249
<i>Keadaan koma ini bisa dipulihkan
dengan suntikan glukagon</i>

208
00:16:17,250 --> 00:16:19,208
<i>dan aku tahu kau selalu membawanya.</i>

209
00:16:21,750 --> 00:16:23,125
<i>Kau akan membunuh Tafa,</i>

210
00:16:23,833 --> 00:16:28,041
<i>lalu setelah itu, kuberi tahu lokasi Noah.</i>

211
00:16:32,166 --> 00:16:33,874
<i>Sekarang, kirim pesan kepada Ted.</i>

212
00:16:33,875 --> 00:16:37,375
