661
00:54:23,708 --> 00:54:27,415
Jaraknya 800 meter ke arah lain.
Aku tak bisa.

662
00:54:27,416 --> 00:54:29,708
<i>- Gunakan ketakutanmu, Maia.</i>
- Persetan!

663
00:54:54,625 --> 00:54:56,583
<i>Mobil polisi menuju ke arahmu.</i>

664
00:55:18,666 --> 00:55:20,957
Hei, berhenti!

665
00:55:20,958 --> 00:55:22,790
Pencuri! Berhenti!

666
00:55:22,791 --> 00:55:24,375
<i>Naik tangga, belok kiri.</i>

667
00:55:37,416 --> 00:55:40,750
<i>Menyeberanglah. Masuk ke gang
di belakang King's College.</i>

668
00:55:47,750 --> 00:55:49,083
Kini belok kiri di Strand.

669
00:56:06,833 --> 00:56:09,041
Ada banyak polisi di persimpangan depan.

670
00:56:09,541 --> 00:56:12,000
Namun, ada jalan pintas menuju jembatan.

671
00:56:13,500 --> 00:56:15,958
<i>Belok kiri melalui Somerset House.</i>

672
00:56:54,083 --> 00:56:56,708
Ada satu polisi menuju
ke arahmu di jembatan.

673
00:56:58,000 --> 00:56:59,083
Berbaur di keramaian.

674
00:57:02,750 --> 00:57:03,583
<i>Dua puluh meter.</i>

675
00:57:07,291 --> 00:57:08,208
<i>Lima belas meter.</i>

676
00:57:11,333 --> 00:57:12,416
<i>Sepuluh meter.</i>

677
00:57:16,791 --> 00:57:17,625
<i>Lima meter.</i>

678
00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:22,666
- Astaga, dia sangat tampan.
- Ya, 'kan?

679
00:57:23,166 --> 00:57:25,166
Apa yang kau lakukan? Mundur.

680
00:57:26,500 --> 00:57:28,416
- Pusat, tersangka…
- Tidak!

681
00:57:31,291 --> 00:57:32,583
- Pistol!
- Berhenti!

682
00:57:33,958 --> 00:57:35,583
Jauhkan tanganmu dari radio.

683
00:57:37,291 --> 00:57:38,291
Tenang.

684
00:57:38,875 --> 00:57:40,915
- Tenanglah.
<i>- Ambil radionya.</i>

685
00:57:40,916 --> 00:57:41,916
Jangan bantu aku.

686
00:57:42,833 --> 00:57:46,375
- Tolong, Nyonya.
- Mundur!

687
00:57:47,125 --> 00:57:49,124
Tolong letakkan pistolnya.

688
00:57:49,125 --> 00:57:50,582
Berikan radiomu.

689
00:57:50,583 --> 00:57:52,000
Berlutut, sekarang.

690
00:57:52,583 --> 00:57:54,375
Kataku, berikan radionya.

691
00:58:00,333 --> 00:58:03,583
Ada beberapa mobil polisi, Maia.
Unit bersenjata.

692
00:58:08,708 --> 00:58:10,165
<i>- Kau terjebak.</i>
- Polisi!

693
00:58:10,166 --> 00:58:13,083
- Polisi, jatuhkan pistolmu!
<i>- Sudah berakhir.</i>

694
00:58:17,833 --> 00:58:20,583
Jika tak patuh,
kami pakai kekerasan mematikan!

695
00:58:22,291 --> 00:58:24,625
<i>Maaf, Noah akan mati tanpamu.</i>

696
00:58:25,375 --> 00:58:27,833
Tidak. Itu tak akan terjadi.

697
00:58:28,500 --> 00:58:31,500
- Bu, biar kubantu.
- Diam.

698
00:58:33,250 --> 00:58:36,207
Apa pun masalahmu, kita bisa selesaikan.

699
00:58:36,208 --> 00:58:39,041
- Letakkan pistolnya!
<i>- Apa yang kau lakukan?</i>

700
00:58:39,708 --> 00:58:41,208
Kukira kau tahu segalanya.

701
00:58:49,583 --> 00:58:52,000
Maia?

702
00:58:58,541 --> 00:58:59,375
Maia!

703
00:59:05,625 --> 00:59:06,791
Dia baik-baik saja?

704
00:59:09,166 --> 00:59:10,707
<i>- Dia baik-baik saja?</i>
- Astaga.

705
00:59:10,708 --> 00:59:12,457
<i>- Dia langsung lompat.
- Astaga.</i>

706
00:59:12,458 --> 00:59:13,541
<i>Ya ampun!</i>

707
00:59:15,208 --> 00:59:16,416
Maia.

708
00:59:20,250 --> 00:59:21,083
<i>Ibu.</i>

709
00:59:27,000 --> 00:59:27,833
<i>Ibu di sini?</i>

710
00:59:35,458 --> 00:59:37,291
Apa yang kau lakukan di sini?

711
00:59:43,291 --> 00:59:47,000
Bawa aku ke sisi selatan Jembatan London.

712
00:59:51,166 --> 00:59:54,458
Jika aku tak tiba di sana enam menit lagi,
putraku akan mati.

713
01:00:18,666 --> 01:00:19,583
Akan kukemudikan.

714
01:00:24,291 --> 01:00:27,624
<i>Seperti yang Anda lihat,
keamanan sudah ketat di Old Bailey</i>

715
01:00:27,625 --> 01:00:31,124
<i>saat tim hukum mulai tiba
untuk sidang pembunuhan Tommy Boyd.</i>

716
01:00:31,125 --> 01:00:34,415
<i>Menariknya, kami dapat laporan
adanya saksi kejutan</i>

717
01:00:34,416 --> 01:00:36,207
<i>di dalam organisasi Tn. Boyd,</i>

718
01:00:36,208 --> 01:00:39,916
<i>yang kesaksiannya akan sangat merugikan
bagi terduga gembong kriminal.</i>

719
01:00:40,750 --> 01:00:42,457
<i>Silakan, Mike, untuk cuaca.</i>

720
01:00:42,458 --> 01:00:44,333
Lihat <i>HMS Belfast</i> di depan?

721
01:00:45,250 --> 01:00:49,125
Aku bisa dekatkan agar kau lompat
ke dermaga, tapi tak bisa berhenti.

722
01:00:50,750 --> 01:00:51,583
Kau bisa?

723
01:00:53,625 --> 01:00:55,833
- Lewat pintu kanan.
- Terima kasih.

724
01:00:57,666 --> 01:00:59,457
Aku melanggar aturan khususmu.

725
01:00:59,458 --> 01:01:01,499
Aturan-aturan bodohmu.

726
01:01:01,500 --> 01:01:03,083
<i>Aturan dibuat untuk dilanggar.</i>

727
01:01:03,958 --> 01:01:05,541
<i>Ini akhir permainan.</i>

728
01:01:25,500 --> 01:01:28,375
Selamat datang di <i>HMS Belfast</i>
Hari yang indah.

729
01:02:06,375 --> 01:02:11,083
Petugas keamanan ada di sini,
bersiap untuk memindahkannya.

730
01:02:11,666 --> 01:02:12,708
<i>Jangan buang waktu.</i>

731
01:02:13,625 --> 01:02:15,250
<i>Napas Noah mulai pendek.</i>

732
01:02:26,375 --> 01:02:27,708
Aku bisa. Baiklah.

733
01:02:50,750 --> 01:02:52,291
Kau ada di sini, bukan?

734
01:02:57,416 --> 01:03:00,750
Ada 267 kamar di hotel ini.

735
01:03:04,041 --> 01:03:06,541
<i>Bisakah kau mencari Noah di antaranya?</i>

736
01:03:08,541 --> 01:03:11,125
<i>Lakukan tugasmu,
lalu kuberi nomor kamarnya.</i>

737
01:03:12,375 --> 01:03:13,541
Permisi, Nyonya.

738
01:03:14,375 --> 01:03:16,125
Kau mau ke mana?

739
01:03:17,000 --> 01:03:18,624
Aku mengunjungi klien.

740
01:03:18,625 --> 01:03:20,333
Imperial Suite, lantai 53.

741
01:03:23,500 --> 01:03:25,708
- Sebentar.
- Tidak.

742
01:03:26,833 --> 01:03:29,415
Dengar, Pak.
Aku tak punya waktu untuk ini.

743
01:03:29,416 --> 01:03:31,290
- Ada…
- Aku tak punya waktu untuk ini.

744
01:03:31,291 --> 01:03:32,874
- Aku harus ke atas.
- Namamu?

745
01:03:32,875 --> 01:03:35,791
- Maia Marten. Ini darurat.
- Maia Marten.

746
01:03:41,041 --> 01:03:42,415
- Ya. Baiklah.
- Pak.

747
01:03:42,416 --> 01:03:43,250
Tak apa.

748
01:03:45,041 --> 01:03:46,750
- Silakan naik, Ny. Marten.
- Bagus.

749
01:03:47,875 --> 01:03:49,083
Selamat siang, Nyonya.

750
01:03:54,333 --> 01:03:55,541
<i>Periksa pistolnya.</i>

751
01:04:02,583 --> 01:04:04,333
<i>Buka ponselmu agar bisa kulihat.</i>

752
01:04:09,416 --> 01:04:11,416
<i>Sedikit pengingat tentang risikonya.</i>

753
01:04:16,916 --> 01:04:19,583
Taruh di tanganmu lagi,
kamera hadap ke depan.

754
01:04:22,041 --> 01:04:24,625
<i>Aku harus melihatmu melakukannya.</i>

755
01:05:06,958 --> 01:05:07,874
Selamat pagi.

756
01:05:07,875 --> 01:05:08,957
Pagi, Nyonya.

757
01:05:08,958 --> 01:05:11,500
Aku perlu mengobrol dengan klienku.

758
01:05:12,083 --> 01:05:13,208
Baru berlari, Bu?

759
01:05:13,916 --> 01:05:14,875
Seumur hidup.

760
01:05:17,458 --> 01:05:19,416
Kau harus mengobati luka itu, Bu.

761
01:05:44,375 --> 01:05:45,500
Masuklah.

762
01:05:46,750 --> 01:05:47,583
Halo, Maia.

763
01:05:49,416 --> 01:05:50,500
Suka jas baruku?

764
01:05:51,416 --> 01:05:52,666
Kubeli untuk hari penting.

765
01:05:55,666 --> 01:05:56,791
Kau tampak berantakan.

766
01:05:59,625 --> 01:06:00,999
Maia?

767
01:06:01,000 --> 01:06:02,666
Tunggu. Apa yang kau lakukan?

768
01:06:16,625 --> 01:06:20,707
Ada apa? Buka pintunya! Buka!

769
01:06:20,708 --> 01:06:23,375
NOMOR TAK DIKENAL
KAU PEMBUNUH - KAMAR 5916

770
01:06:59,541 --> 01:07:02,041
Lepaskan! Aku mau lewat!

771
01:07:02,875 --> 01:07:04,125
Ayolah, Sayang. Jalan.

772
01:07:05,458 --> 01:07:06,916
Minggir!

773
01:07:32,791 --> 01:07:34,791
Astaga.

774
01:07:35,375 --> 01:07:37,165
Baik, Noah, bangun.

775
01:07:37,166 --> 01:07:38,416
Ibu di sini. Bangun.

776
01:07:39,958 --> 01:07:40,833
Noah, bangun.

777
01:07:50,750 --> 01:07:53,000
Noah.

778
01:07:54,041 --> 01:07:55,833
Noah. Ayo, bangunlah.

779
01:07:56,500 --> 01:07:57,333
Noah, ayolah.

780
01:08:01,166 --> 01:08:03,541
Noah. Sayang, jangan tinggalkan Ibu.

781
01:08:04,208 --> 01:08:05,041
Kembalilah.

782
01:08:11,000 --> 01:08:12,208
Bangun, Sayang.

783
01:08:29,458 --> 01:08:30,333
Ibu?

784
01:08:37,166 --> 01:08:38,208
Hei, Sayang.

785
01:08:39,333 --> 01:08:41,083
Bu, aku haus.

786
01:08:47,125 --> 01:08:50,666
Akan Ibu ambilkan apa pun.

787
01:08:51,250 --> 01:08:52,541
Maafkan Ibu.

788
01:08:53,500 --> 01:08:55,125
Ibu sangat menyayangimu.

789
01:09:24,250 --> 01:09:25,125
Ny. Marten.

790
01:09:25,750 --> 01:09:26,833
Detektif Phillips.

791
01:09:28,375 --> 01:09:30,000
Dia masih di sini, bukan?

792
01:09:31,458 --> 01:09:34,583
Gedung ditutup. Hanya layanan darurat
yang boleh keluar masuk.

793
01:09:38,583 --> 01:09:42,208
- Semoga anakmu bisa mengenalinya.
- Dia tak ingat apa pun.

794
01:09:43,208 --> 01:09:44,083
<i>Pembunuh.</i>

795
01:09:47,791 --> 01:09:50,250
- Maia.
- Pak, berhenti.

796
01:09:51,666 --> 01:09:52,500
Bisa aku…

797
01:09:53,000 --> 01:09:55,375
Boleh aku bicara dengan mereka?

798
01:09:55,958 --> 01:09:58,583
Pak, aku harus memintamu
menjauhi tersangka.

799
01:10:00,375 --> 01:10:01,208
Noah.

800
01:10:02,541 --> 01:10:04,916
Ini Ted, teman Ibu.

801
01:10:06,333 --> 01:10:07,625
Kau anak yang berani.

802
01:10:11,541 --> 01:10:14,125
Ada hal lain. Ted, maukah kau…

803
01:10:15,125 --> 01:10:17,666
Tentu saja. Hei. Ayo periksa ke paramedis.

804
01:10:19,458 --> 01:10:22,458
- Bu.
- Tak apa. Hanya beberapa menit.

805
01:10:23,000 --> 01:10:24,415
- Kau baik-baik saja?
- Ya.

806
01:10:24,416 --> 01:10:25,500
Bagus.

807
01:10:31,250 --> 01:10:33,250
Katanya, dia punya rencana cadangan.

808
01:10:34,333 --> 01:10:38,000
Situasi akan kacau
dan banyak orang akan terluka.

809
01:10:38,625 --> 01:10:40,458
Kurasa dia punya bom.

810
01:10:43,583 --> 01:10:45,791
Umumkan Kode Hitam Gegana.

811
01:10:59,958 --> 01:11:01,624
- Tidak!
- Bu. Hentikan.

812
01:11:01,625 --> 01:11:02,916
Apa yang kau lakukan?

813
01:11:03,791 --> 01:11:05,666
Cuma berikan satu dosis glukagon lagi.

814
01:11:11,041 --> 01:11:14,041
Maaf. Kurasa aku lepas kendali.

815
01:11:16,750 --> 01:11:17,750
Jangan khawatir.

816
01:11:21,083 --> 01:11:22,875
Bu, aku mau kencing.

817
01:11:24,875 --> 01:11:25,708
Petugas Thompson.

818
01:11:43,500 --> 01:11:45,250
Tunggu di sini, kuperiksa toilet.

819
01:11:53,333 --> 01:11:54,208
Noah?

820
01:12:00,333 --> 01:12:01,582
Itu dia.

821
01:12:01,583 --> 01:12:03,290
Buka pintunya! Dia di sini!

822
01:12:03,291 --> 01:12:05,083
Buka pintunya!

823
01:12:06,750 --> 01:12:07,875
Buka pintunya!

824
01:12:08,916 --> 01:12:10,083
Buka pintunya!

825
01:12:15,708 --> 01:12:16,833
Tolong mundur.

826
01:12:17,458 --> 01:12:20,125
Saksi mau lewat. Harap mundur.

827
01:12:27,208 --> 01:12:31,208
<i>99 persen cerita pembelaan diri
akan mengendalikan narasi.</i>

828
01:12:50,458 --> 01:12:53,040
HUBUNGI TED MCBAIN DI STAR CHAMBERS
TELEPON KABEL

829
01:12:53,041 --> 01:12:56,125
NOAH AKAN DIBUNUH
JIKA AKU TAK MENEMBAK TAFA! - MAIA

830
01:13:09,916 --> 01:13:11,958
Tolong beri kesempatan lagi.

831
01:13:14,416 --> 01:13:15,750
<i>Waktumu 15 menit.</i>

832
01:13:16,583 --> 01:13:17,582
Terima kasih.

833
01:13:17,583 --> 01:13:19,457
TOLONG! TED
PELURU KOSONG, DARAH PALSU

834
01:13:19,458 --> 01:13:21,499
TAK ADA TELEPON, POLISI, RADIO.

835
01:13:21,500 --> 01:13:22,665
PELURU KOSONG

836
01:13:22,666 --> 01:13:24,416
KANTONG DARAH

837
01:13:35,291 --> 01:13:36,833
Permisi, Nyonya.

838
01:13:41,250 --> 01:13:42,540
TUNGGU SATU MENIT!

839
01:13:42,541 --> 01:13:44,083
PELURU KOSONG
DI LIFT 3

840
01:14:11,833 --> 01:14:13,208
Aku pantas dapat medali.

841
01:14:26,625 --> 01:14:28,000
Aku bukan pembunuh.

842
01:14:34,875 --> 01:14:37,040
Ada tembakan!

843
01:14:37,041 --> 01:14:38,500
Jangan bergerak!

844
01:14:39,541 --> 01:14:40,916
Hei! Tiarap!

845
01:14:44,458 --> 01:14:46,458
Pegang tasnya. Berlutut!

846
01:14:51,291 --> 01:14:53,708
Sudah aman. Bom sudah dilucuti.

847
01:15:22,166 --> 01:15:26,249
Kesaksian saksi kunci Radian Tafa
merugikan pihak pembela.

848
01:15:26,250 --> 01:15:28,707
Tafa mengaitkan Tn. Boyd dan rekannya

849
01:15:28,708 --> 01:15:31,415
dengan pembunuhan
Nona Summerhill dan Nona Patel.

850
01:15:31,416 --> 01:15:33,124
<i>Sepertinya akan ada keadilan</i>

851
01:15:33,125 --> 01:15:35,874
<i>bagi keluarga
dari dua wanita muda tak bersalah ini.</i>

852
01:15:35,875 --> 01:15:38,874
<i>Sulit membayangkan
Tn. Boyd bisa lolos dari hukuman penjara.</i>

853
01:15:38,875 --> 01:15:40,416
KESAKSIAN MENJERAT BOYD

854
01:15:51,375 --> 01:15:54,291
Tak ada orang lain
yang bisa melakukan ini.

855
01:15:55,791 --> 01:15:58,208
Aku hanya ceritakan kisah
yang ingin dia percaya.

856
01:15:59,750 --> 01:16:01,250
Trik klasik pengacara.

857
01:16:07,291 --> 01:16:08,125
Terima kasih.

858
01:16:09,291 --> 01:16:10,375
Kubantu sebisaku.

859
01:16:11,583 --> 01:16:14,291
Aku akan mampir besok siang.

860
01:16:14,958 --> 01:16:16,166
Untuk lihat keadaanmu.

861
01:16:32,416 --> 01:16:33,291
Baiklah.

862
01:16:34,000 --> 01:16:35,541
- Kau siap?
- Ya.

863
01:17:03,500 --> 01:17:05,875
Ranselmu hilang, tetapi…

864
01:17:08,250 --> 01:17:09,500
Ranger Merah!

865
01:17:12,000 --> 01:17:14,833
PENELEPON TAK DIKENAL

866
01:23:34,500 --> 01:23:36,582
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Dyah D. Anggarini

867
01:23:36,583 --> 01:23:38,583
Supervisor Kreasi
Kiki Alek